        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Patrick Vieira, Paul Scholes, Jens Lehmann\n- Events: 2005 FA Cup Final, penalty shoot-out\n- Topics: football honors, trophies\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2005 FA Cup Final, Arsenal won the penalty shoot-out 5–4.\n- In the 2005 FA Cup Final shoot-out, Arsenal goalkeeper Jens Lehmann saved Paul Scholes' shot.\n- In the 2005 FA Cup Final shoot-out, Patrick Vieira scored the winning penalty for Arsenal.\n- Paul Scholes is described as the most decorated English footballer of all time.\n- Paul Scholes is described as one of the most successful footballers in history.\n- Paul Scholes won a total of 25 trophies, including 11 Premier League titles and two Champions League titles.",
